start

:Open KeePass;
:Select to add an entry;

if(Leave all fields empty?) then(no)
:Fill 1-9 fields as needed;

if(Fills in password field?) then(yes)
:Repeat password field is not identical;
:“the repeated password must be identical with the password” appears;
else(no)
endif

switch(Selection)
